## 2026-06-22 — SC core working; one upstream bugfix

Implemented src/main/scala/Supercompiler.scala:
  * Matching: freeMentions/freeRefs (binder-aware), hygienic subst, bound-name
    canonicalization (canon), alphaEqual, renaming (bijective), instanceOf (folding),
    homeomorphic embedding (whistle), msg (anti-unification). 7 unit tests green.
  * SC: reduce (Lower laws to fixpoint, no Call-inlining), drive (reduce + bottom-up
    supercompile of Call subterms), scCall (fold-by-instance -> whistle-by-embedding ->
    generalize-by-msg -> makeNode+unfold), residualize to Residual(top, routines).
    Safety caps (maxNodes/maxDepth) turn whistle bugs into errors, not hangs.

BUGFIX (upstream, src/main/scala/MORKL.scala): Lower.UnwrapConcat_Unwraps stripped
prefix factors in REVERSED order: `Unwrap(src, l·r) => Unwrap(Unwrap(src, r), l)`.
Correct (and consistent with formal.egg `Unwrap(Wrap p s, p·q) = Unwrap s q`) is
`Unwrap(Unwrap(src, l), r)`. Latent because no prior test drove Routine.optimized over
an Unwrap(_,Concat); my aunt-query driving (family("child" x person)) is the first.
Fixed. Full suite still green.

Tests: **67 passing / 0 failing** (was 56). New SCDriver soundness suite proves the
residual eval-AGREES with the original on:
  - transitive closure (self-recursive, 1 mention)   [terminates, sound]
  - reachable (self-recursive, 3 mentions)            [terminates, sound]
  - aunt query (non-recursive iter pipeline)          [sound; yields the 3 aunts]
  - predecessor_helper (self-recursive accumulator)   [terminates, sound]

Behavior understood & confirmed:
  - supercompile(routine generically) -> faithful specialized residual (soundness).
  - Direct self-calls always instance-fold (formal params are fresh vars), so the
    whistle is reserved for STRUCTURED divergence (static-data growth, cross-routine).
  - supercompile(call with STATIC data) -> partial evaluation: data baked into the
    residual, params dropped, intermediate spaces fused by `reduce`; a fully-static
    recursive fixpoint is unrolled to its answer then folds when stable (compile-time
    solve). This is the headline optimization to showcase on the examples.

Next: guiding examples. Order: (1) lot.metta loader + Aunt graph query; (2) datalog
semi-naive + carac transitive/two-hop; (3) n-queens; (4) sliding puzzle 3x3/4x4;
(5) Game of Life + fred.rle; (6) NOAA temperature slice. Each: express in MORKL, run
SC, assert residual eval == reference answer, and record what the SC achieved.

