  n-queens/15-puzzle never fold); Range/freeMentions traversals must be total.
- smt: whole-program ∀-goals under nested binders are FO-hard even at k=1 — the structural-diff
  decomposition is what makes them tractable; binder-free shared subterms emit as define-funs.
